    "headline": "Edison International Reports Second Quarter 2026 Results",
    "summary": "ROSEMEAD, Calif., July 30, 2026--Edison International (NYSE: EIX) today reported second-quarter net income of $534 million, or $1.39 per share, compared to net income of $343 million, or $0.89 per share, in the second quarter of last year. As adjusted, second-quarter core earnings were $592 million, or $1.54 per share, compared to core earnings of $374 million, or $0.97 per share, in the second quarter of last year.",
